    "body": "@domenic thanks,\r\n\r\nI don't think this works as I am describing. consider this:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<span>foo</span>\r\n<div class=\"third-party\">\r\n  <span>bar</span>\r\n</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\n```css\r\nspan {\r\n  color: red;\r\n}\r\ndiv.third-party {\r\n  all: initial !important;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe span inside the div would still be red.",
